Taking just enough out is unnecessary for getting protection; the priest
only looks at the donation, not at what you're keeping in your wallet.

You always get the AC reduction when you donate 400*XL (no need to
donate even one zorkmid more) until your intrinsic AC (what it would be
if you were naked, no need to strip either) is 1. After that, it's a
chance of 1 in (10 - current intrinsic AC); if you don't get lucky,
*then* you get the 'selfless generosity' message.

